{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Heyman Jacobs: Den schat der armen oft een medecijn-boecxken (1626)"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:70302"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Vrijwilligersnetwerk Nederlandse Taal (©), SVNT"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"N. van der Sijs"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/072728442"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"N. van der Sijs"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Vrijwilligersnetwerk Nederlandse Taal"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Den Schat der Armen Oft een Medecijn-Boecxken, dienstelijck voor alle Menschen, inhoudende hoemen sijne ghesondtheydt onderhouden sal. Daer by veelderhande simpele Remedien ende Medicamenten, om veelderhande sieckten met cleyne costen seer lichtelijck te ghenesen. Ende wat daer voorts meer in te lesen is, dat vindtmen aen de ander zijde. Opera Heym. Iacobi. Ad laudem & gloriam Dei. Een wijs Philosooph seydt, Dat de ghesondtheydt eenen onbekenden rijckdom is, maer is aenghenamer den ghenen die van een sware sieckte ghenesen zijn, als die noyt sieck oft cranck geweest hebben. Op een nieuw oversien, verbetert ende vermeerdert. T’ANTWERPEN, By Hieronymus Verdussen inde Camerstraet inden rooden Leeuw. 1626.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date: 2017"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Medicine, Health and Life Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Linguistics"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Menselijke geneeskunde"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Geneesmiddelen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Herbal medicine"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Heyman Jacobs (1596-1645 fl.)"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2017-01-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Vrijwilligersnetwerk Nederlandse Taal (©), SVNT"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"H. Beelen (Carl von Ossietzky Universität Oldenburg (D))"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"pri